{%- comment -%}
  About page, light version (draft, November 2026).
  Preview without touching the live page: /pages/about?view=about-new
  Photos are placeholders from the existing product imagery; Mert will swap them.
{%- endcomment -%}

<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: 'Inter';
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 300 500;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url('{{ 'inter-latin.woff2' | asset_url }}') format('woff2');
  }
</style>

<div class="ab-page">

<section class="ab-hero">
  <div class="ab-hero-text reveal">
    <span class="section-label">About MUNLER</span>
    <h1 class="ab-hero-title">Designed by us.<br>Delivered by us.</h1>
    <p>MUNLER is a small London brand run by a couple. We design every piece ourselves, choose every material, pack every order by hand, and wherever we can, deliver it to your door ourselves.</p>
  </div>
  <figure class="ab-hero-img ab-hero-img--land reveal">
    <img src="{{ 'about-hero-solenne-wide.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="2000" height="1493"
         alt="The Solenne full-length mirror in a bedroom" fetchpriority="high">
  </figure>
</section>

<section class="ab-rows">

  <div class="ab-row reveal">
    <figure class="ab-row-img ab-row-img--land">
      <img src="{{ 'about-story-brook-black-wide.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="2000" height="1493"
           alt="The Brook mirror in Matte Black above a wooden console in a bright living room" loading="lazy">
    </figure>
    <div class="ab-row-text">
      <span class="section-label">How it started</span>
      <h2>A ten-square-metre room in London</h2>
      <p>We are two people who have always loved design, from two very different worlds. One of us is a civil engineer who spent years on London building sites, where a material is chosen for how it performs. The other comes from law.</p>
      <p>We kept looking for a mirror that felt like a piece of design rather than an afterthought, and we couldn&rsquo;t find one. So in the small room we were living in at the time, we started drawing our own.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ab-row ab-row--flip reveal">
    <figure class="ab-row-img">
      <img src="{{ 'about-design-brook-gold.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="1493" height="2000"
           alt="The Brook asymmetrical mirror above a marble console" loading="lazy">
    </figure>
    <div class="ab-row-text">
      <span class="section-label">Our design</span>
      <h2>Every shape is drawn by us</h2>
      <p>We design every MUNLER piece ourselves, and we only release one when we would happily hang it in our own home. Brook and Solenne were the first.</p>
      <p>There are many more shapes on our table. We&rsquo;ll bring them out slowly, one at a time, rather than fill a catalogue for the sake of it.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ab-row reveal">
    <figure class="ab-row-img ab-row-img--land">
      <img src="{{ 'about-materials-solenne-wide.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="2000" height="1493"
           alt="The Solenne mirror leaning in a sunlit room" loading="lazy">
    </figure>
    <div class="ab-row-text">
      <span class="section-label">Materials</span>
      <h2>The best materials, at a fair price</h2>
      <p>Our frames are brushed stainless steel, so they won&rsquo;t rust, even in a bathroom. The glass is copper-free and lead-free silver mirror, which is kinder to the environment and stays clear for longer.</p>
      <p>We want MUNLER to feel premium without a showroom price. We sell directly to you, with no shops and no middlemen in between, and that is how we keep it within reach.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ab-row ab-row--flip reveal">
    <figure class="ab-row-img ab-row-img--land">
      <img src="{{ 'about-door-brook-hall-wide.jpg' | asset_url }}" width="2000" height="1493"
           alt="The Brook mirror above a marble console in an entrance hall" loading="lazy">
    </figure>
    <div class="ab-row-text">
      <span class="section-label">From us to your door</span>
      <h2>We often deliver it ourselves</h2>
      <p>It&rsquo;s just the two of us, so we do everything ourselves. We pack every mirror by hand, and wherever we can, we drive it to your door. Once, that meant taking a mirror all the way from London to Glasgow, just to make sure it arrived safely.</p>
      <p>And when you email us, one of us will be the one who replies.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>

<section class="ab-facts">
  <ul class="ab-facts-list">
    <li><strong>Free UK delivery</strong><span>Packed by hand, on every order</span></li>
    <li><strong>5-year warranty</strong><span>Against defects in materials and workmanship</span></li>
    <li><strong>30-day returns</strong><span>If it isn&rsquo;t right, send it back</span></li>
    {%- assign jm_total = 0 -%}
    {%- assign jm_sum = 0.0 -%}
    {%- for p in collections.all.products -%}
      {%- assign jm_count = p.metafields.reviews.rating_count | default: 0 -%}
      {%- if jm_count > 0 -%}
        {%- assign jm_total = jm_total | plus: jm_count -%}
        {%- assign jm_str = p.metafields.reviews.rating.value | append: '' -%}
        {%- assign jm_part = jm_str | times: jm_count -%}
        {%- assign jm_sum = jm_sum | plus: jm_part -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
    {%- if jm_total > 0 -%}
      {%- assign jm_avg = jm_sum | divided_by: jm_total -%}
      <li><strong>Rated {{ jm_avg | round: 1 }} out of 5</strong><span>From {{ jm_total }} customer review{% if jm_total != 1 %}s{% endif %}</span></li>
    {%- endif -%}
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="ab-close">
  <div class="ab-close-inner reveal">
    <span class="section-label">Still small</span>
    <h2>This is only the beginning</h2>
    <p>Right now MUNLER is two people and a small collection. We plan to grow it slowly, one carefully made piece at a time. Thank you for being here at the start.</p>
    <div class="ab-close-actions">
      <a href="/collections/all" class="btn btn-dark">Shop the collection</a>
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="btn btn-outline">Say hello</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</div>
